# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the Live page (SEL + HOME; twice more, through the progression, to
# leave): chords on the keys, the modifiers armed for the next chord, a bass set apart and let go, the octave, Snap,
# the live macros on the knobs. Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
wait 600
expect view 15
shot live-empty.png
wav live-page.wav
tapkey 7
wait 2500
shot live-c.png
leds
tapkey 13
tapkey 20
wait 300
shot live-armed.png
tapkey 4
wait 2500
shot live-am7.png
tapkey 13
tapkey 20
tapkey 22
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 26
wait 200
shot live-bass-armed.png
tapkey 11
wait 2500
shot live-fmaj7-e.png
leds
tapkey 26
wait 2000
turn ALGO 20
tapkey 20
tapkey 17
tapkey 2
wait 2500
shot live-g7sus4.png
turn K2 -50
wait 2000
shot live-thin.png
turn K2 50
turn K1 60
wait 2000
shot live-bright.png
tap OCT-
wait 2000
press SEL
tapkey 2
release SEL
wait 2500
shot live-off.png
wavstop
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
wait 600
expect view 15
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
wait 600
expect view 0
